    "qualification_limitations": [
      "Task-component variant only: V-006 and V-017 full-case, provider, connector and campaign receipts remain UNRUN and are not replaced.",
      "Native control acts on real slot-UID process trees, files and the actual 12.4-capture HTTPS/PostgreSQL/15.2 service; no live provider sandbox, broker-managed agent launch or frontier connector is exercised.",
      "runner.job.execute budget attachment and PREPARATION staging are linked and called but not exercised end-to-end (no authenticated 12.4 job claim fixture); staging is exercised through runner.preparation.stage and budget primitives through the kernel fixture.",
      "Pre-launch cancellation is fenced at the coordinator and in the native ledger; the 12.2 broker does not yet consult the native fence before START.",
      "Final merged-source manifests require refreshed complete inventory pins."
    ]
